{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/m8wb31","slideIndex":1,"text":"现有工作已研究图学习辅助切换、联合接入与卸载、多智能体控制及参数化混合动作，不能概括成“尚无人研究联合优化”。本文更具体的切入点是：已有与潜在竞争如何同时影响每个候选卫星的卸载请求和选择价值。参考现有稿件引言：[3] Shen et al., JSAC 2021, Graph Neural Networks for Scalable Radio Resource Management；[4] Fu et al., Chinese Journal of Computers 2026, A Multi-Agent Heterogeneous Graph Representation-Based Handover Method；[5] Yang et al., TCCN 2025, Joint Access Selection and Computation Offloading；[10] Xiong et al., arXiv:1810.06394, 2018；[11] Yang et al., Sensors 2023, Computation Offloading and Resource Allocation Based on P-DQN. 来源：C:/Users/19704/Desktop/leo_switch.pdf，第I节。"}
